sequenceDiagram
    participant DSO as Grid Operator
    participant CSMS as Central System (CSMS)
    participant Charger as Charging Station (EVSE)
    participant EV as Electric Vehicle (EV)

    Note over DSO, CSMS: Grid Operator detects peak energy demand

    DSO->>CSMS: Grid Signal (e.g., via OSCP)<br>Requests grid support

    activate CSMS
    Note over CSMS: CSMS decides to initiate V2G and selects an available EV
    CSMS->>Charger: OCPP: SetChargingProfile.req <br>(Sends profile with negative power value to command discharge)
    activate Charger

    Charger-->>CSMS: OCPP: SetChargingProfile.conf<br>(Confirms receipt of command)

    Note over Charger, EV: Charger communicates with EV to start discharge
    Charger->>EV: ISO 15118: Negotiate Discharge
    activate EV
    EV-->>Charger: ISO 15118: Confirm Discharge
    deactivate EV

    Note over Charger, EV: Bidirectional energy transfer begins (EV -> Grid)

    Charger->>CSMS: OCPP: TransactionEvent.req<br>(eventType: Updated, chargingState: "Discharging")
    CSMS-->>Charger: OCPP: TransactionEvent.conf

    loop Periodic Energy Reporting
        Charger->>CSMS: OCPP: MeterValues.req<br>(measurand: "Energy.Active.Export.Register")
        CSMS-->>Charger: OCPP: MeterValues.conf
    end